#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:12
msgid "Tutorials"
msgstr "教程"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:14
msgid ""
"This chapter provides detailed hands-on tutorials to help you gain an in-"
"depth understanding of various application scenarios of Kaiwu-PyTorch-"
"Plugin."
msgstr "本章提供详细的实践教程，帮助您深入了解 Kaiwu-PyTorch-Plugin 的各种应用场景。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:16
msgid ""
"Before you start, make sure you have KPP installed and have gone through the"
" [Quick Start](../quickstart.md). For theoretical background, see "
"[Theoretical Foundations](../../theoretical-foundations/index.md)."
msgstr ""
"开始之前，请确保您已安装 KPP "
"并完成[快速入门](../quickstart.md)。理论背景请参阅[理论基础](../../theoretical-"
"foundations/index.md)。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:18
msgid "Quantum Sampling for Energy-Based Models"
msgstr "基于能量模型的量子采样"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:29
msgid ""
"[Why Quantum? Revisiting the Sampling "
"Bottleneck](quantum_sampling_bottleneck.md): The intractable partition "
"function, slow MCMC mixing, and the quantum alternative."
msgstr ""
"[为何需要量子？重访采样瓶颈](quantum_sampling_bottleneck.md)：难以计算的配分函数、缓慢的 MCMC "
"混合，以及量子替代方案。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:30
msgid ""
"[Simulated Annealing for Ising Models](simulated_annealing.md): Mapping "
"energy functions to Ising Hamiltonians and building a local sampling "
"baseline."
msgstr ""
"[用于 Ising 模型的模拟退火](simulated_annealing.md)：将能量函数映射为 Ising 哈密顿量，并建立本地采样基线。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:31
msgid ""
"[Integrating Quantum Samplers into PyTorch](quantum_sampling_pytorch.md): "
"Swapping the local SA sampler for the CIM sampler within the KPP training "
"loop, with the core interfaces explained."
msgstr ""
"[将量子采样器集成到 PyTorch](quantum_sampling_pytorch.md)：在 KPP 训练循环中将本地 SA 采样器替换为 "
"CIM 采样器，并说明核心接口。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:33
msgid "Tutorial 1: Generative Modeling with a Full Boltzmann Machine"
msgstr "教程 1：全连接玻尔兹曼机生成建模"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:42
msgid ""
"[BM Generation](bm_generation.md): Unsupervised data generation with a fully"
" connected Boltzmann Machine. Example: `example/bm_generation/`."
msgstr ""
"[BM 生成](bm_generation.md)：使用全连接玻尔兹曼机进行无监督数据生成。示例：`example/bm_generation/`。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:44
msgid "Tutorial 2: Feature Learning and Classification with RBMs and DBNs"
msgstr "教程 2：RBM 与 DBN 的特征学习与分类"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:54
msgid ""
"[RBM Classification: Handwritten Digit Recognition](rbm_classification.md): "
"Feature learning and classification with a single RBM. Example: "
"`example/rbm_digits/rbm_digits.ipynb`."
msgstr ""
"[RBM 分类：手写数字识别](rbm_classification.md)：使用单个 RBM "
"进行特征学习与分类。示例：`example/rbm_digits/rbm_digits.ipynb`。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:55
msgid ""
"[DBN Classification: Deep Belief Networks](dbn_classification.md): Stacking "
"RBMs into a Deep Belief Network for hierarchical features. Example: "
"`example/dbn_digits/supervised_dbn_digits.ipynb`."
msgstr ""
"[DBN 分类：深度信念网络](dbn_classification.md)：将 RBM "
"堆叠为深度信念网络以学习层次化特征。示例：`example/dbn_digits/supervised_dbn_digits.ipynb`。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:57
msgid "Tutorial 3: Quantum Variational Autoencoder (Q-VAE)"
msgstr "教程 3：量子变分自编码器（Q-VAE）"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:66
msgid ""
"[Q-VAE: Quantum Variational Autoencoder](qvae_mnist.md): Replacing the "
"Gaussian prior with a quantum RBM for image generation and representation "
"learning. Example: `example/qvae_mnist/run_pipeline.py`."
msgstr ""
"[Q-VAE：量子变分自编码器](qvae_mnist.md)：用量子 RBM "
"替代高斯先验，用于图像生成与表征学习。示例：`example/qvae_mnist/run_pipeline.py`。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:68
msgid "Coming Soon"
msgstr "即将推出"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/index.md:70
msgid "Planned tutorials, following the same structure as Tutorial 1–3:"
msgstr "计划中的教程，遵循与教程 1–3 相同的结构："

msgid ""
"**Q-VAE for Single-Cell Transcriptomics**: single-cell representation "
"learning with a QVAE: expression matrix → low-dimensional representations → "
"UMAP → clustering evaluation. Example: "
"`example/qvae_cell/train_qvae_cell.ipynb`."
msgstr ""
"**Q-VAE 用于单细胞转录组学**：使用 QVAE 进行单细胞表示学习：表达矩阵 → 低维表示 → UMAP → "
"聚类评估。示例：`example/qvae_cell/train_qvae_cell.ipynb`。"

msgid ""
"**Q-Diffusion for Protein Sequence Generation**: discrete diffusion "
"generation for proteins with the generic Q-Diffusion core and a DPLM "
"backbone. Example: `example/qdiffusion/simple/simple_train_example.py`."
msgstr ""
"**Q-Diffusion 用于蛋白质序列生成**：使用通用 Q-Diffusion 核心与 DPLM "
"主干进行蛋白质的离散扩散生成。示例：`example/qdiffusion/simple/simple_train_example.py`。"

